      <draw:text-box>
       <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Implemented locality/retention: https://github.com/crasni/LeCoach/blob/ff24d09/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md</text:span></text:p>
       <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T5">https://github.com/crasni/LeCoach/blob/ff24d09/src/lecoach/coaching/README.md</text:span></text:p>
       <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T5">No cloud inference fallback. Raw capture buffers/latest JPEG are volatile. Prepared models are local. Model acquisition and optional explicit development exports are distinct from default rehearsal storage. Not a completed security audit or encryption guarantee.</text:span></text:p>
      </draw:text-box>
