     <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T18">Operator reports cover transcription, audience changes and feedback after stop.</text:span></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T18">They do not establish quantified recognition accuracy or learning outcomes.</text:span></text:p>
