      <draw:text-box>
       <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Implementation: https://github.com/crasni/LeCoach/blob/ff24d09/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md and https://github.com/crasni/LeCoach/blob/ff24d09/src/lecoach/coaching/README.md</text:span></text:p>
       <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Operator-reported functional batch: https://github.com/crasni/LeCoach/issues/11#issuecomment-6095334266</text:span></text:p>
       <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Reported Ubuntu/Bluetooth microphone functional checks passed, not independently repeated in deck authoring. Automated synthetic cases cover empty/missing/late/repeated/drain evidence. Exact run metrics and final presenter/browser coaching acceptance are separate.</text:span></text:p>
      </draw:text-box>
