     <draw:frame draw:name="Notes Placeholder 2" presentation:style-name="pr17" draw:text-style-name="P16" draw:layer="layout" svg:width="0cm" svg:height="0cm" svg:x="0cm" svg:y="0cm" presentation:class="notes" presentation:user-transformed="true">
      <draw:text-box>
       <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Proposed 175-second shot plan and 309-word CPU live narration: https://github.com/crasni/LeCoach/blob/1f4607a/checks/coaching/demo/narration.md</text:span></text:p>
       <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Scenario/reproduction: https://github.com/crasni/LeCoach/blob/ff24d09/checks/coaching/demo/README.md</text:span></text:p>
       <text:p text:style-name="P11"><text:span text:style-name="T5">Revised read-through and final edit duration remain unmeasured. An earlier approximately 2:20 reading belongs to the old 316-word script. Final presenter/browser run and authorized recording/publication remain separate. Live shots must use actual run observations; never substitute fixture timestamps or guarantee moment counts.</text:span></text:p>
      </draw:text-box>
     </draw:frame>
